WEBVTT

00:01.000 --> 00:04.300
What I want to know is why you
wouldn't fight me seriously!

00:04.300 --> 00:08.100
There's no point to a fight like that
if you don't do it in earnest!

00:08.100 --> 00:11.440
You don't understand how I feel at all!

00:36.630 --> 00:44.240
Umareta machi o tooku hanarete atashi wa

00:44.240 --> 00:47.410
Utatte iru

00:47.410 --> 00:55.050
Yowai kokoro mo yureru omoi mo poketto ni

00:55.050 --> 00:58.320
Shimaikonde

00:58.320 --> 01:08.900
Te no naru hou e michi naru michi e

01:08.900 --> 01:14.340
Ayumou

01:14.340 --> 01:19.740
Susumou

01:19.740 --> 01:24.580
Dare ka no tame ja naku

01:24.580 --> 01:30.050
Aru ga mama hokoreru you ni

01:30.050 --> 01:35.520
Yoake ni taiyou ga noboru you ni

01:35.520 --> 01:40.760
Atashi wa melody o kizamu

01:40.760 --> 01:44.790
Hakanakutomo tsuyoku

01:46.430 --> 01:49.960
Atashi wa ikite yuku

01:55.510 --> 01:59.340
Episode 32
The Nation's Agenda

02:12.490 --> 02:14.360
Morning, Mickey!

02:14.760 --> 02:16.730
Hey, morning, Pinot.

02:16.730 --> 02:19.220
You're certainly in high spirits today, huh?

02:19.870 --> 02:23.940
Well, you see Zed and Roya
are back from Neotopia!

02:23.940 --> 02:25.910
Huh? Really?!

02:25.910 --> 02:29.580
They'll both be surprised when they
find out about this place!

02:29.580 --> 02:32.570
I can't wait to see their surprised expressions.

02:35.080 --> 02:38.650
This is truly a fine mess you've made.

02:38.650 --> 02:44.090
What if this damages our alliance with
Neotopia at such a critical time?

02:44.090 --> 02:47.260
Correction: our alliance has
already been damaged!

02:48.330 --> 02:52.860
We received a demand from Neotopia
earlier to extradite you two.

02:54.370 --> 02:58.570
As the ruling Council, we've no choice
but to comply with this demand.

02:58.570 --> 03:01.280
It was all my fault!

03:01.280 --> 03:04.640
It only happened because of my careless actions.

03:05.410 --> 03:08.120
Zed only tried to help me!

03:08.120 --> 03:09.740
Silence!

03:10.850 --> 03:13.760
I don't want to hear any excuses
from you at this point!

03:13.760 --> 03:16.380
For shame...

03:18.030 --> 03:21.480
A sage should not raise his voice like that!

03:22.200 --> 03:23.930
Master Zico!

03:23.930 --> 03:25.560
Zico...

03:26.370 --> 03:29.900
This time we cannot do as you say!

03:29.900 --> 03:33.510
This matter is fast becoming an
international incident!

03:33.510 --> 03:37.710
Then, we just have to obtain pardon
from Hyrum Maximum.

03:37.710 --> 03:39.110
What?!

03:39.110 --> 03:41.380
Is such a thing possible?

03:46.450 --> 03:49.660
Sebastian filled me in on everything.

03:49.660 --> 03:53.030
There was no fault in your actions.

03:53.030 --> 03:55.460
You two did a good job.

03:56.660 --> 03:58.030
Master Zico...

03:58.030 --> 04:01.300
Let me handle the rest.

04:02.070 --> 04:03.700
Yes, sir.

04:04.540 --> 04:09.440
By the way, did either of you gain
anything from your experience?

04:11.010 --> 04:15.350
I found a light...

04:15.350 --> 04:18.680
It's still small and faint,

04:19.890 --> 04:23.550
but I think I can find my own way now.

04:24.990 --> 04:26.690
I see.

04:26.690 --> 04:29.660
And how about you, Zed?

04:30.770 --> 04:34.570
I didn't get a single thing out of it.

04:36.070 --> 04:38.060
I only lost something.

05:00.630 --> 05:04.100
King Hugh, I've come to report in.

05:04.100 --> 05:06.200
What am I?!

05:06.200 --> 05:07.940
Sire...

05:07.940 --> 05:11.060
You are a perfect being.

05:12.040 --> 05:13.940
Wrong...

05:13.940 --> 05:16.540
Not at all! You are the king, sire!

05:16.540 --> 05:18.380
Wrong.

05:18.380 --> 05:21.980
You are the king who shall rule
over all the world, sire!

05:21.980 --> 05:24.580
Wrong!

05:25.890 --> 05:27.690
Then tell me why!

05:27.690 --> 05:30.490
Why am I not chosen?!

05:30.860 --> 05:33.930
K..King Hugh...

05:33.930 --> 05:35.560
Why?

05:36.530 --> 05:39.500
Why am I unfit?

05:39.500 --> 05:42.570
What is it I lack?

05:42.570 --> 05:47.100
Why, why, why?!

05:55.950 --> 05:57.590
Ah, yes!

05:57.590 --> 05:59.640
If that's it...

06:16.040 --> 06:20.370
I never thought that you would
disobey the Absolute Law.

06:21.780 --> 06:24.440
Was it out of concern for your friend?

06:25.650 --> 06:28.980
Feelings are the bane of wisdom!

06:28.980 --> 06:31.950
" People find happiness through their feelings" ?

06:31.950 --> 06:34.250
That is an illusion!

06:35.990 --> 06:38.460
There are no exceptions to Absolute Law.

06:39.030 --> 06:41.460
You will be punished!

06:41.460 --> 06:43.600
Please wait, Holy Father!

06:43.600 --> 06:46.600
Through Noah's efforts to preserve
Absolute Law thus far,

06:46.600 --> 06:49.200
he has contributed greatly to our cause.

06:49.200 --> 06:53.870
He also won the Joust and even
saved Your Holiness's life.

06:54.510 --> 06:58.580
There is no one in Neotopia who
could take Noah's place.

06:58.580 --> 07:01.100
He is Neotopia's savior!

07:03.550 --> 07:05.850
I have brought a visitor, Your Holiness.

07:22.240 --> 07:25.930
Ta-da! Here's my shop!

07:29.240 --> 07:31.710
No way! How did you do it?

07:31.710 --> 07:34.250
Well, my bread has been really well-received,

07:34.250 --> 07:36.350
and so with a little help from Master Sebastian,

07:36.350 --> 07:39.050
I was able to lease my own shop!

07:39.050 --> 07:42.820
Whoa, this is amazing...

07:42.820 --> 07:45.350
Wow, it looks delicious!

07:46.160 --> 07:48.400
And your shop is so pretty and charming.

07:48.400 --> 07:50.130
Just what I'd expect from you, Mickey!

07:50.130 --> 07:51.930
Right, Zed?

07:52.600 --> 07:54.230
Yeah...

07:55.570 --> 07:57.040
Zed...

07:57.040 --> 07:59.640
What's the matter with Zed?

07:59.640 --> 08:02.200
Oh, he's just a little, uh...

08:03.240 --> 08:05.040
I'm back!

08:05.980 --> 08:07.780
Welcome back, Pinot!

08:07.780 --> 08:09.980
All the deliveries are done!

08:09.980 --> 08:12.550
Nice job, that must have tuckered you out.

08:12.550 --> 08:15.220
No, I'm perfectly fine.

08:15.220 --> 08:16.320
You sure?

08:16.320 --> 08:17.390
I'm sure.

08:17.390 --> 08:18.990
Are you really sure?

08:18.990 --> 08:21.400
I'm really sure.

08:21.400 --> 08:24.460
Hey, Mickey, who's she?

08:25.300 --> 08:26.900
Oh, I'll introduce you.

08:26.900 --> 08:29.900
This is Pinot, she's a maid for Mr. Robès.

08:29.900 --> 08:32.070
We're running this shop together.

08:32.070 --> 08:33.870
Nice to meet you!

08:34.640 --> 08:35.910
Nice to meet...

08:35.910 --> 08:37.750
Hey, you got a girlfriend?!

08:37.750 --> 08:39.510
N..No, that's not it.

08:39.510 --> 08:42.220
I'm just helping out a little bit.

08:42.220 --> 08:43.990
Calling her my "girlfriend", well...

08:43.990 --> 08:46.590
...that's embarrassing!

08:46.590 --> 08:48.160
But I appreciate all your help, Pinot!

08:48.160 --> 08:49.490
I thought Mickey had a crush on me.
But I appreciate all your help, Pinot!

08:49.490 --> 08:51.930
I thought Mickey had a crush on me.
Oh, stop it, Mickey!

08:51.930 --> 08:53.720
I mean it!

08:54.360 --> 08:56.260
I really mean it!

08:56.260 --> 08:57.890
Really?

09:00.370 --> 09:03.860
Hey, let's all go on a picnic or something!

09:05.610 --> 09:08.080
But the shop, well...

09:08.080 --> 09:09.110
You know?

09:09.110 --> 09:11.550
Yeah! I'd love that!

09:11.550 --> 09:13.610
Yeah! Let's go!

09:23.820 --> 09:27.350
I hear my people have caused
you some headaches.

09:28.230 --> 09:31.000
I'm sorry about that.

09:31.000 --> 09:34.530
Won't you leave dealing with those two to me?

09:35.040 --> 09:38.610
That boy, Zed, who holds the key spirit...

09:38.610 --> 09:41.510
He has dreadful power.

09:41.510 --> 09:44.750
He can therefore be seen as a danger.

09:44.750 --> 09:49.080
Absolute Law is especially necessary
in the case of people like him.

09:50.520 --> 09:53.190
You've certainly changed.

09:53.190 --> 09:56.860
You go out of your way to condemn power,

09:56.860 --> 10:00.130
yet at the same time, you hold a Joust,

10:00.130 --> 10:03.220
and you seek power of your own.

10:04.070 --> 10:06.400
What is going on here?

10:06.400 --> 10:08.470
In this war-torn era, the reality is

10:08.470 --> 10:13.740
if one desires peace, one needs power
as a means to achieve it.

10:16.480 --> 10:18.270
That's...

10:20.720 --> 10:27.620
For that, I would act out a farce
centered around a false spirit!

10:33.230 --> 10:35.030
That's amazing, Roya!

10:35.030 --> 10:37.000
I'm jealous!

10:37.000 --> 10:39.970
I learned from Zico himself, after all!

10:40.970 --> 10:43.270
What do you think of my skills?

10:43.270 --> 10:44.900
Nice...

10:48.910 --> 10:50.950
Ouch...

10:50.950 --> 10:52.410
You all right?

10:52.410 --> 10:55.350
Good grief, Pinot, you're so hasty.

10:55.350 --> 10:57.350
No, I'm not!

10:57.350 --> 11:00.190
You're the hasty one, Mickey!

11:00.190 --> 11:02.460
No, you're the hasty one.

11:02.460 --> 11:05.190
No, you're the hasty one.

11:10.000 --> 11:11.860
Hey, Zed, catch anything?

11:12.800 --> 11:14.070
Yeah...

11:14.070 --> 11:17.000
Wow! It's huge!

11:17.000 --> 11:18.630
Yeah...

11:21.240 --> 11:23.400
How about we have it for lunch?

11:30.580 --> 11:34.450
Isn't it about time you told me
where we're headed?

11:36.120 --> 11:41.460
Zico, do you still believe in the value
of what we call "power"?

11:42.700 --> 11:45.720
Do you believe in a future that will
be brought about by power?

11:47.370 --> 11:51.210
Ah, not necessarily,

11:51.210 --> 11:54.940
but you could say I still have my doubts.

11:55.840 --> 11:59.610
It's possible there never has been an answer.

12:00.980 --> 12:02.780
It's just...

12:03.720 --> 12:06.550
I regret what happened back then.

12:08.520 --> 12:11.090
As do I.

12:11.090 --> 12:15.530
However, I found a sure answer
in the midst of my regret.

12:22.500 --> 12:24.470
Look, Zico.

12:26.070 --> 12:30.200
This is my answer, a symbol of Absolute Law:

12:31.350 --> 12:33.440
the Stupa of Truth!

12:34.450 --> 12:37.180
The Stupa of Truth?

12:37.180 --> 12:42.920
Yes, absolute Law shall spread out
across all lands from here.

12:50.970 --> 12:52.590
Hyrum...

12:54.270 --> 12:58.870
Wow! You're quite a cook, Roya!

12:58.870 --> 13:01.010
Oh, no, I'm not.

13:01.010 --> 13:03.140
I'll have to do my best too.

13:04.110 --> 13:07.080
Hey, so how long have you and
Mickey been going steady?

13:08.350 --> 13:12.190
Well, Mickey started coming to make
deliveries at the Redondo estate,

13:12.190 --> 13:14.660
and the rest is just history, kind of.

13:14.660 --> 13:17.020
Oh yeah? I see.

13:17.020 --> 13:18.650
Ow!

13:19.230 --> 13:21.460
I cut my finger.

13:22.630 --> 13:23.960
Was it the face?!

13:23.960 --> 13:25.590
Huh?

13:26.630 --> 13:29.700
So, how was Neotopia?

13:29.700 --> 13:32.500
You got to see the friend you'd been
wanting to see for so long, right?

13:35.710 --> 13:38.150
One of your friends, huh?

13:38.150 --> 13:40.740
Must be a swell guy.

13:45.390 --> 13:48.720
There's something I figured out
after I came to this world.

13:49.560 --> 13:54.520
In my heart, I always hated you.

13:56.960 --> 13:59.930
That's right, I hated you.

14:05.340 --> 14:07.910
I'd like to meet him too, sometime.

14:07.910 --> 14:10.880
Hey, why don't you invite him to Templar?

14:14.250 --> 14:16.820
You just won't shut up, will you?

14:16.820 --> 14:19.450
Don't you ever bring that up again!

14:21.790 --> 14:23.420
Zed...

14:29.160 --> 14:31.560
I'm sorry, Mickey.

14:32.500 --> 14:34.300
It's okay.

14:35.840 --> 14:37.630
I'm sorry.

14:38.770 --> 14:40.770
C'mon, let's have some lunch.

14:40.770 --> 14:42.740
Pinot and Roya are waiting for us.

14:43.580 --> 14:45.200
Right...

15:20.810 --> 15:23.080
Where is Gitra?

15:23.080 --> 15:25.250
He always does this.

15:25.250 --> 15:27.490
Absent again?

15:27.490 --> 15:31.120
What is the man thinking?

15:36.030 --> 15:41.440
Then, why don't we start with a report
on the Joust held in Neotopia?

15:41.440 --> 15:43.300
Regarding that...

15:44.340 --> 15:46.270
I hear that Hugh took on an alias

15:46.270 --> 15:49.580
and participated in the Joust as
a representative of Tusk.

15:49.580 --> 15:51.280
Just what is the meaning of this?

15:51.280 --> 15:53.750
I heard nothing of this!

15:53.750 --> 15:56.320
It wasn't anything you had a need to know about.

15:56.320 --> 16:00.620
I thought you had left me in charge of the Joust!

16:00.620 --> 16:05.130
All was done with Great Tusker's
resurrection in mind,

16:05.130 --> 16:08.230
for that is what motivates our actions.

16:08.230 --> 16:10.030
Have no fear.

16:10.030 --> 16:11.130
But!

16:11.130 --> 16:13.870
Enough, return to your den.

16:13.870 --> 16:15.840
Xeem!

16:17.040 --> 16:18.830
Return.

16:23.110 --> 16:26.610
How long do you plan to keep that
beastman on the throne?

16:26.610 --> 16:29.020
Just a little longer now.

16:29.020 --> 16:32.540
He is a necessary pawn in the
next stage of my plan.

16:34.860 --> 16:36.790
And the key spirits?

16:36.790 --> 16:41.890
As anticipated, both Amir Gaul and
Sachura have been confirmed.

16:44.800 --> 16:47.130
And one other thing...

16:49.200 --> 16:53.830
When Hugh tried to invoke Amir Gaul,
it caused a spirit rejection.

16:56.080 --> 16:57.870
Naturally.

17:00.580 --> 17:04.650
Those two will be ours before long.

17:04.650 --> 17:08.960
It will not be long before the remaining
key spirits are in the palms of our hands.

17:08.960 --> 17:13.660
And the one qualified to possess them
when they are all gathered,

17:13.660 --> 17:16.560
the true savior...

17:16.560 --> 17:18.900
We all know who that person will be.

17:22.900 --> 17:24.530
Zico...

17:25.370 --> 17:29.140
I shall consider the matter of Zed and his friend.

17:29.140 --> 17:30.940
Thank you.

17:32.350 --> 17:33.970
Diana!

17:37.520 --> 17:39.650
Hyrum! Prepare to die!

17:39.650 --> 17:41.590
You take care of these two, Lady Diana.

17:41.590 --> 17:43.390
All right!

17:47.590 --> 17:51.120
Do you have any idea what you're doing?

17:53.130 --> 17:54.760
Now!

17:56.840 --> 18:00.300
Die, Hyrum!

18:05.880 --> 18:06.880
Did they get him?!

18:06.880 --> 18:08.680
All right!

18:11.050 --> 18:12.850
Get them!

18:15.990 --> 18:17.620
What?!

18:22.430 --> 18:24.230
Sachura?!

18:24.230 --> 18:26.390
I will punish you here as well!

18:29.470 --> 18:31.270
Go, Sachura!

18:43.850 --> 18:45.820
Use the Anti-Spirit System!

18:56.830 --> 18:58.460
Sachura?

19:10.610 --> 19:12.350
Punish me?

19:12.350 --> 19:14.250
Don't make me laugh.

19:14.250 --> 19:16.920
The ones who must be punished...

19:16.920 --> 19:18.890
The ones who must die...

19:20.090 --> 19:21.880
Are you scum!

19:27.130 --> 19:28.750
Diana?!

19:38.040 --> 19:39.670
Damn!

20:05.470 --> 20:09.460
In the name of Absolute Law,
I hereby punish you.

20:30.560 --> 20:34.730
You have saved my life twice now.

20:34.730 --> 20:39.530
You may indeed be the paragon
of Absolute Law.

20:43.540 --> 20:46.740
I shall forgive your crime.

20:46.740 --> 20:48.540
Your Holiness!

20:49.580 --> 20:55.120
Will you continue to devote your
powers to Neotopia?

20:55.120 --> 20:58.080
Yes! It will be my pleasure.

21:25.210 --> 21:27.580
This is my mom.

21:29.180 --> 21:30.980
You're surprised, right?

21:33.550 --> 21:36.080
It's nice to meet you.
My name's Noah.

21:47.170 --> 21:49.970
He's no longer...

21:56.410 --> 22:00.240
Zed, I want you to understand.

22:28.680 --> 22:30.640
That's Zed's...

22:44.790 --> 22:49.560
Tatoe hanareteta to shite mo

22:49.560 --> 22:53.600
Omoi wa tsunagareteru yo

22:53.600 --> 22:57.170
Kono saki mo itsumade demo

22:57.170 --> 23:03.510
Zutto zutto hikatte itakute (stay gold)

23:03.510 --> 23:08.380
Kagayaite itakute (stay gold)

23:08.380 --> 23:12.050
My old days kawarazu sawagu weekend

23:12.050 --> 23:15.890
Tada tanoshikute muchi de rikutsunuki de

23:15.890 --> 23:19.760
Grateful days matatakuma no tsukihi de

23:19.760 --> 23:24.030
Mina ano hi kara hanare sorezore mezashiteru

23:24.030 --> 23:26.700
Otona ni natte omoide wa mune te o futte

23:26.700 --> 23:27.870
Mukau saki o mitsume

23:27.870 --> 23:31.510
Tatakatteru sugata omotte makenai otagai mae ni

23:31.510 --> 23:33.610
Soba ni inakute mo kamawanai

23:33.610 --> 23:35.580
Egao mitakute mo ima ja nai

23:35.580 --> 23:37.580
Furikaeru hodo " ltsuka miseru" to

23:37.580 --> 23:39.840
ltsumade mo kawaranai

23:40.410 --> 23:45.220
Tatoe hanareteta to shite mo

23:45.220 --> 23:49.290
Omoi wa tsunagareteru yo

23:49.290 --> 23:52.890
Kono saki mo itsumade demo

23:52.890 --> 23:59.230
Zutto zutto hikatte itakute (stay gold)

23:59.230 --> 24:04.930
Kagayaite itakute (stay gold)

24:17.280 --> 24:20.950
Next Time
Lost Luster

24:17.580 --> 24:20.950


Next time, "Lost Luster"
